# Drift k8s-node events: each violates the redis SBoB on a Kubernetes node and
# MUST fire the mapped drift rule, PLUS the attribution chain (100070 base +
# 100071 podmap-unresolved when the podmap is not seeded with the pod uid
# 0f3c8ed9-9d6b-4a1c-b5f2-7c1e0a9d1234; scripts/sbob-podmap-refresh.sh seeds
# both spellings — seed the map and expect 100070 only).
#   execve /usr/bin/curl          -> 100011 (SBoB drift: process ...)
#   open /etc/shadow             -> 100021 (SBoB drift: file open ...)
#   connect 185.220.101.4:4444   -> 100031 (SBoB drift: connect ...)
# attribution (cgroup v2 underscore form on all three; the v2-dash and v1
# forms are exercised in the benign corpus).

