# Signature events (rulePolicies, M4): node-scoped keys fire-by-default; the
# cgroup decoder stamps sbob.pod_uid so the attribution base (100070, plus
# 100071 while the podmap is unseeded) fires alongside the signature rule.
#   init_module (module load)     -> 100060 (SBoB signature: module-load ...)
#   ptrace (process tracing)      -> 100062 (SBoB signature: process-tracing ...)

